      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Smart-contract / circuit risk",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The Solana ZK ElGamal bug — quietly patched by validators before public disclosure — demonstrated that a single ZK circuit error can create a systemic infinite-mint exploit with no on-chain warning and no user visibility.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Matter Labs filing to trademark the term 'ZK' across 9 countries and unilaterally controlling the distribution of 3.6B ZK tokens reveal that foundational ZK infrastructure is concentrated in single corporate entities despite decentralization branding.",
          "source": "https://dune.com/matter_labs/zksync-era-overview"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Privacy / coercion risk",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Vitalik explicitly stated that ZK proofs alone cannot prevent coercion and must be combined with MPC, FHE, or TEE — meaning the privacy guarantees most ZK identity and payment projects market are structurally incomplete.",
