        },
        {
          "dimension": "Ecosystem / project viability",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Nocturne's ZK privacy protocol shutdown and ZKsync Era's transaction spike collapsing within days of the ZK token launch illustrate that ZK projects frequently cannot sustain organic usage beyond airdrop-driven incentive windows.",
